      "writtenOn": "2021-02-17T01:23:57Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Discussed in our meeting earlier - OEM_ANY wouldn\u0027t be appropriate for a NetworkIdentity. OEM_NONE is used to construct probeIdent under the assumption that the NetworkTemplate passed to us was constructed with one of the builder functions in NetworkTemplate, which default to OEM_MANAGED_ALL, which ignores the OEM managed state. OEM_NONE may be misleading here, and I should add a comment explaining that any valid integer value would really work, but we need to pass a valid value for the NetworkIdentity constructor.\n\nTODO for me - add a comment",
