        "id": 1565997
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-02-17T20:21:43Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I added a comment to the other location that OEM_NONE is used, but I\u0027m wondering if it might be more appropriate to create a private helper \"createProbeIdent\" in NetworkPolicyManagerService (such that the documentation for what this probeIdent means can be in one place).\n\nLet me know what you think.",
      "parentUuid": "a779dac9_cde674a8",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1618,
        "startChar": 16,
        "endLine": 1618,
        "endChar": 24
      },
      "revId": "3d59b4ace76c00bf5f477471f4131bce1010588d",
